(7445837, 1178083, 50641, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2016-03-25 00:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445840, 1178069, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nice splash!</td>', 'Nice splash!', '2016-03-25 00:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445845, 1178069, 6519, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, but she desperately needs a drop shadow and a partial reflection in the water to make her even slightly believably (see the reflection of the trees along the north side of the river). <br/> <br/>P.S. the angle of light is pretty good, so the added touches would have made this way more "real".</td>', 'Cute concept, but she desperately needs a drop shadow and a partial reflection in the water to make her even slightly believably (see the reflection of the trees along the north side of the river).  P.S. the angle of light is pretty good, so the added touches would have made this way more "real".', '2016-03-25 05:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445846, 1178105, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it......... which part of this image is the one that is "ridiculously disproportionate?" Are you suggesting that the fire is too much for them to handle? If that is it, then sorry.......... but they are actually LIGHTING it as a precaution. Seems all quite under control to me.</td>', 'I don''t get it......... which part of this image is the one that is "ridiculously disproportionate?" Are you suggesting that the fire is too much for them to handle? If that is it, then sorry.......... but they are actually LIGHTING it as a precaution. Seems all quite under control to me.', '2016-03-25 05:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445847, 1177839, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yes, that proboscis is a bit much thanks to the lens and camera angle. However, it also has nothing in focus and offers nothing I would possibly want to look at or find mildly interesting (note: just because it isn''t pretty, does NOT mean it isn''t worthwhile).</td>', 'Yes, that proboscis is a bit much thanks to the lens and camera angle. However, it also has nothing in focus and offers nothing I would possibly want to look at or find mildly interesting (note: just because it isn''t pretty, does NOT mean it isn''t worthwhile).', '2016-03-25 05:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445848, 1178089, 6519, '<td valign="top">Huh? What is the point of this image? An unconnected overlay? Sorry, I just don''t understand your motives here...........</td>', 'Huh? What is the point of this image? An unconnected overlay? Sorry, I just don''t understand your motives here...........', '2016-03-25 05:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445850, 1177895, 6519, '<td valign="top">That seems to be perfectly reasonable, expected, truthful proportions to me ( in a VERY harsh, not-so-focused image). I don''t understand your point.</td>', 'That seems to be perfectly reasonable, expected, truthful proportions to me ( in a VERY harsh, not-so-focused image). I don''t understand your point.', '2016-03-25 05:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445851, 1178073, 6519, '<td valign="top">Cute!!! Little figurines keep doing rather badly for me, but I do like this concept, anyway, so there!!!!!</td>', 'Cute!!! Little figurines keep doing rather badly for me, but I do like this concept, anyway, so there!!!!!', '2016-03-25 05:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445852, 1178101, 6519, '<td valign="top">I might be sadly mistaken, but I think this image might have passed on a lesser rule set, too (e.g. advanced, or even basic). It is lovely and cute!!!</td>', 'I might be sadly mistaken, but I think this image might have passed on a lesser rule set, too (e.g. advanced, or even basic). It is lovely and cute!!!', '2016-03-25 05:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
